<p>Aaja asghar lori sunau..(2)<br> khali jhula kaise jhulau<br> Aaja asghar lori sunau<br> khali jhula kaise jhulau<br> Aaja asghar lori sunau</p> 
<p>Dil se lagau, naaz uthau<br> aaja asghar lori sunau</p> 
<p>1. Kaale gesu, rang sunehra<br> kitna hasee'n tu, chaand hai mera<br> khaak o lahu mein, lekin dooba<br> phoolo jaisa, tera chehra<br> dhoop mein ran ki, kaise bachau<br> aaja asghar lori sunau</p> 
<p>2. Ek ek pehlu, teri khushboo<br> chaaro taraf hai, mere phaili<br> tera kurta, tera shaluka<br> aise basa hai, yaad me meri<br> jitna sochu, doobti jaau<br> aaja asghar lori sunau</p> 
<p>3. Chaand se badhkar, tera ujaala<br> maine safar mein,&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; tujhko paala<br> rehgayi hasrat, ghar ke sahan mein<br> na tu chala aur, na tu khela<br> ungli pakadkar, tujhko chalau<br> aaja asghar lori sunau</p> 
<p>4. Akbar mera, pehne sehra<br> tumko banau, mai shahwala<br> makhmal jaise, phoolo wala<br> chhota sa ek, pyaara sehra<br> sar pe tumhare, beta sajaau<br> aaja asghar lori sunau</p> 
<p>5. Nazuk se gardan pe tumhari<br> maine suna hai, zakhm laga hai<br> kaisa sitam zalim ne kiya hai<br> tu chhota hai, teer bada hai<br> roti jaau, kehti jaau<br> aaja asghar lori sunau</p> 
<p>6. Kyu na padhe salman o raza hum<br> nauhe ke soorat mein lori<br> lori sunane ki hasrat thi<br> jo na hui madar ki puri<br> kehti thi mai, mar na jau<br> aaja asghar lori sunau</p>